      value: 1.0047096
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Trainer Tips - The Pok\xE9mon that deals the finishing blow on the
        opponent gets all of the XP, regardless of whether other Pok\xE9mon battled."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "This may be frustrating, but you can use Rare Candies to level up weak
        Pok\xE9mon without ever sending them into battle."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Use them to raise Pok\xE9mon that don't have any attacking moves to
        start out."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Or you could save them for endgame. It's your call.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: Actually, now that I think of it, I think I just need to start running.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: ... Eh, I'll do it later.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
